<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on the CAC 40 index.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on the CAC 40 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank NA has issued 120 million call and put warrants, in 12 equal tranches, on the CAC 40 index, lead manager Citibank SA said.</p>
<p> PAYDATE	17.OCT.96		   MIN EXER LOT 10,000</p>
<p>LISTING	   PARIS			SPOT REF     2110</p>
<p>WARRANTS  STRIKE  ISS PRICE   PREMIUM     GEARING     MATURITY</p>
<p>CALL A    2300    0.83 FRF     12.94 PCT  25.4 TIMES  17.OCT.97</p>
<p>CALL B    2100    1.76 FRF	7.87 PCT  12.0 TIMES  17.OCT.97</p>
<p>CALL C    1900    3.12 FRF	4.83 PCT   6.8 TIMES  17.OCT.97</p>
<p>CALL D    1800    3.90 FRF	3.79 PCT   5.4 TIMES  17.OCT.97</p>
<p>PUT E     2300    2.82 FRF    - 4.36 PCT   7.5 TIMES  17.OCT.97</p>
<p>PUT F     2200    2.13 FRF    - 5.83 PCT   9.9 TIMES  17.OCT.97</p>
<p>PUT G     2100    1.55 FRF    - 7.82 PCT  13.6 TIMES  17.OCT.97</p>
<p>PUT H     2000    1.08 FRF    -10.33 PCT  19.5 TIMES  17.OCT.97</p>
<p>PUT I     1900    0.73 FRF    -13.41 PCT  28.9 TIMES  17.OCT.97</p>
<p>PUT J     1800    0.50 FRF    -17.06 PCT  42.2 TIMES  17.OCT.97</p>
<p>CALL K    2400    1.20 FRF     19.43 PCT  17.6 TIMES  19.OCT.98</p>
<p>CALL L    2200    2.05 FRF     13.98 PCT  10.3 TIMES  19.OCT.98</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
